	(text "Battery: 3.7 V Li-ion, ideally 1000 mAh and at least 1A continuous. ( 2A Would be Great )\nPower: TPS2116DRL prioritizes USB-C over Battery. You can use both at the same time.\nAudio: MAX98357A with an 8 Ω speaker, powered separately from 3.3 V.\nNo 4Ω Speaker if Battery max disch. under 1.5A if possible.\nESP32: On This Module , GPIO6 is wired internally to INT2 of the IMU.\nConsider disabling it in software. Also , the I2S Audio modules are\nusing UART default pins so Debug and Flash will be made with USB conn.  "
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 177.546 174.244 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "Verdana")
				(size 1.143 1.143)
				(bold yes)
